Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.86,0:00:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did grandpa really go alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I told you he was the bravest man I ever knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.85,0:01:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that night...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I could see the fear in his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But even then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.99,0:01:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He never let that fear stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He always chose to do what was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when it meant putting everyone else before himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.84,0:01:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And what happened next, grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This story is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:04:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.85,0:05:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided I should be the one to wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the least I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Others wished to wait for you as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.85,0:05:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but I advised them not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The journey is long enough as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Others?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Remus, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He even wished to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But when his wife arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he understood it was time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then came Ginny Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She was the hardest to persuade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She cared for you so deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Severus Snape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even he wished to wait for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.49,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was my place to be here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,after everything I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kings Cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather perculiar, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you understand now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,that you and Voldemort have been bound by more than fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.59,0:06:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since that night so many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A part of him lives inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Lived, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.75,0:06:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Voldemort himself destroyed it just moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:06:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But do you feel as though you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.39,0:07:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He attacked me. And I woke up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're here. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.90,0:07:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you leave anything behind worth going back for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.24,0:07:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.69,0:07:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.09,0:07:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right, professor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.47,0:07:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,about what you told me during the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.55,0:07:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the Yule Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We fought for so many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,somehow we could never stay away from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We always found our way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.30,0:08:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When we were children,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't have known what to call it back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I love her, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.49,0:08:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Back the way we came.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or, Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You may come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The road is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And I would welcome your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You may choose, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.65,0:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You have always had that choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But he hit me with the killing curse...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And I no longer have my mother's protection...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:09:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't forget what that protection was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Love, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've always had more than enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.61,0:09:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do hurry, Harry,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.61,0:09:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,or you'll be left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.09,0:09:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.07,0:09:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them all I'm alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.01,0:10:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone check him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia, my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.86,0:10:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,my little dragon princess, is she alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.47,0:11:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.23,0:11:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all going to Hogwarts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me carry him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A first year Gryffindor defeating a mountain troll,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you really are impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.91,0:11:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I've been thinking of giving you another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:11:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:11:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've done something worthy of your famous name,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided to give you another chance to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That riff-raff you associate with simply isn't worthy of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.77,0:12:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep spending time with them and their dreadful manners would rub off on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And their vulgar habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't even get me started on their smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Blegh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobdy walks away while I'm talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.61,0:12:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My father will hear about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have wanted to be my friend, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All you ever wanted was to walk alongside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were so afraid of what people might think,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,of what they'd say about a Malfoy being friends with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.90,0:13:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we spent all those years alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.35,0:13:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And in trying so hard to be a Malfoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you forgot how to be yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.64,0:13:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But at what cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Malfoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor, I-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He... he's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.53,0:14:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He went into the forest...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He went to let that monster kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.72,0:14:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to stop him, professor. I did, but-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't... I lost him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost him forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Child, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why on earth would he do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there's a part of Voldemort living inside him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And unless it was destroyed, he'd keep coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.63,0:14:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So... he found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The night Harry survived,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Albus and I knew something wasn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.67,0:14:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Voldemort couldn't have fallen so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We both suspected something terrible had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:15:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But nearly ten years passed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.18,0:15:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearly ten years... and nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.68,0:15:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Harry finally came to Hogwarts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.87,0:15:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew the dreadful life he'd endured with those relatives of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.86,0:15:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And I promised myself that whatever happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.31,0:15:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogwarts would be his home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.57,0:15:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted him to have something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Something of his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.96,0:15:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For heaven's sake, I bought the boy his first broomstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.41,0:15:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, in his second year,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.37,0:15:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,then we learned he could speak to snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.26,0:15:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My worst fears were confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to Albus,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.49,0:15:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,to witches and wizards across the world—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.24,0:15:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone who might help...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one could offer a solution...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there wasn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.09,0:15:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So all I could do was pray,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and hope nothing terrible would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But every year things only grew worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The tournament...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Voldemort...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.03,0:16:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Albus' death...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.00,0:16:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.87,0:16:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I was his teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.31,0:16:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I failed him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed you both, Miss Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.36,0:16:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'm going to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.80,0:16:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing he asked of me was to look ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And be happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know how...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.26,0:16:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to do that without him...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.57,0:16:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,By remembering him, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.91,0:16:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,By remembering him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.81,0:17:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Th-They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Hagrid carrying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia... are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry Potter...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.32,0:18:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...is dead!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.26,0:18:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to pledge your allegiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Join me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:18:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.43,0:19:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.79,0:19:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My golden snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.69,0:19:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you been hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.50,0:20:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He was never the most diligent student.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He got himself into trouble more often than anyone could count.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.86,0:20:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And some of those situations were so absurd,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.72,0:21:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,we couldn't help wondering how he got himself into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But he never ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He always faced them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.52,0:21:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.22,0:21:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That was what made him extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.09,0:21:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,His courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He faced things most of us could scarcely imagine standing against.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And when the time came to give his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.95,0:21:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.63,0:21:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,he did so without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this castle, now lying in ruins,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.24,0:21:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.41,0:21:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,we were his entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The home he treasured more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.65,0:21:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And he would never have surrendered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.63,0:22:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you surrender it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.98,0:22:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you follow him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.79,0:22:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to live...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.41,0:22:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,...on my knees!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.91,0:22:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.75,0:22:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So what
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,if Harry's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,People die everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.10,0:22:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.57,0:22:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.97,0:22:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we lost so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.30,0:22:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're still here...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.43,0:22:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...inside us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.10,0:22:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry's... still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.26,0:22:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...with Fred.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.93,0:22:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...Remus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.93,0:22:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...with all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.26,0:22:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Their deaths were not in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.87,0:23:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.19,0:23:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...this is what you've chosen, daughter of pure blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you filthy mudblood!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she doing...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.35,0:23:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.43,0:23:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let everyone know...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,your father, Tom Riddle, was a muggle!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if you're the heir of Slytherin?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't change the fact that you're a miserable...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.52,0:23:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...disgusting...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...pathetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.96,0:23:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,...filthy mudblood!!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.76,0:24:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So... the serpent does have fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.08,0:24:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucius, you should be proud of your daughter's courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.21,0:24:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I hope you'll remember that courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.29,0:24:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And the look on her face when she dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.55,0:24:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.42,0:24:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.18,0:24:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.25,0:24:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.88,0:25:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No... no... no... no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.28,0:25:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.87,0:25:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What the dev-
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.98,0:25:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.05,0:25:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.78,0:25:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.13,0:25:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.87,0:25:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.22,0:26:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have drawn that sword from the hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.83,0:26:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible!!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.68,0:26:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.18,0:26:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.16,0:26:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.75,0:26:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What... is... happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.86,0:26:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Missed me, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.05,0:26:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't kill me as a baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.04,0:27:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,don't expect to manage it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.20,0:27:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,For I admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.63,0:27:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,getting back wasn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.58,0:27:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.78,0:27:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.75,0:27:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.20,0:27:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made him angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.68,0:28:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter!!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.44,0:28:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now! Their morale is broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.02,0:28:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.19,0:28:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.32,0:28:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be no mercy for anyone who flees!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.32,0:28:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.31,0:28:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Defend Hogwarts!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.86,0:28:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Push them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.96,0:28:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll tear you to pieces so you can never rise again!!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.48,0:29:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get to Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.93,0:29:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.09,0:29:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia. The snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.82,0:29:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Find it! Don't let it escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.18,0:29:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.34,0:30:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just you and me, you stupid worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.50,0:30:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And just so you know, I've never liked snakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.19,0:30:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy, we've come to-
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.88,0:30:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.21,0:30:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you going to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.62,0:30:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.76,0:30:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You kill it, we'll cheer you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.40,0:30:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.51,0:30:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.31,0:31:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't kill her, Harry won't last much longer against Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.50,0:31:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the size of that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.94,0:31:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've changed my standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.31,0:31:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Snakes first. Spiders second.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.49,0:31:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect. Once I've killed the snake, you're next, Weasley.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.34,0:31:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.34,0:31:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Harry fight one even bigger than that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.09,0:31:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.54,0:31:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a plan. She'll eat all three of us out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.80,0:31:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.89,0:31:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The corridors are badly damaged. We can hide in the rubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.80,0:31:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't be able to move freely!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.91,0:32:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you still alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.97,0:32:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I have reasons to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.20,0:32:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of an answer is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.09,0:32:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.68,0:32:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll tear off your arms and legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.11,0:32:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll keep you alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.05,0:32:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Long enough to watch me tear everyone you love apart piece by piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.35,0:32:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting with that traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.56,0:32:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.30,0:32:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking about Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.41,0:32:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this the way we started, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.60,0:32:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Together!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.48,0:32:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To hell with the snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:32:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you with my bare hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.50,0:33:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'd kill me with your bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.31,0:33:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.59,0:33:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll break your courage and fill you with despair!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.93,0:33:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.87,0:33:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.82,0:33:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.75,0:33:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.85,0:34:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumbledore's most loyal dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.91,0:34:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Riddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.21,0:34:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you hurt anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.24,0:34:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you call me that!!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.99,0:34:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what you've always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.26,0:34:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even behind that hideous face.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.70,0:34:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with you in a moment, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.28,0:34:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.30,0:34:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.18,0:34:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.47,0:34:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.49,0:34:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.72,0:34:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong words,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.52,0:34:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,for a walking corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.88,0:35:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shackebolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.51,0:35:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You waste your talent and power fighting for mudbloods.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.24,0:35:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Join my army.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.43,0:35:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And glory shall be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.44,0:36:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already chosen my side, you filthy snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.97,0:36:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.80,0:36:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Kingsley!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.29,0:36:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Break his arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.18,0:36:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.94,0:37:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You nearly defeated me, Shacklebolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.44,0:37:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.49,0:37:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But there won't be a second time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.08,0:37:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.06,0:37:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a headache!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.43,0:37:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to say the same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.44,0:37:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.07,0:37:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.80,0:37:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't expect any mercy from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.84,0:38:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Confringo!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.54,0:38:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We attack from both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.02,0:38:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If she dodges one of you, the other strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.54,0:38:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And why am I the one holding the fang?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.42,0:38:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.48,0:38:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.68,0:38:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.96,0:39:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No... way...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.97,0:39:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.68,0:39:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.14,0:39:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I was joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.00,0:39:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.70,0:39:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.13,0:40:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a hand, milady?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.04,0:40:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Peeves...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.16,0:40:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never thought I'd say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.95,0:40:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm so glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.91,0:40:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That speech you gave in the courtyard. Oooph!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.51,0:40:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Touched my very soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.68,0:40:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it? Soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.74,0:40:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a- oh nevermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.12,0:40:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to cover, I'll distract her!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.45,0:40:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, scaly?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.22,0:40:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't touch me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.96,0:41:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.92,0:41:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My head still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.04,0:41:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I need a holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.52,0:41:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.62,0:41:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Peeves is distracting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.94,0:41:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Peeves?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.52,0:41:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That Peeves?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.27,0:41:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know, it's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.09,0:41:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's make the most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.76,0:41:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.44,0:41:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.75,0:41:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It-it fell outside the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.18,0:41:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.38,0:41:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.68,0:41:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.82,0:41:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, try killing her with the fang while Peeves distracts her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.38,0:41:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.46,0:41:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna borrow the fang instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.12,0:41:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.32,0:41:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.83,0:42:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire gorgeous body hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.79,0:42:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with him distracting her,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.49,0:42:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,getting close won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.79,0:42:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't fancy another tail whipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.05,0:42:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing really hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.95,0:42:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.26,0:42:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.54,0:42:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I was rather sad when they left me out of the films.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.97,0:42:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in the video games, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.01,0:42:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but I wanted to shine on the big screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.99,0:42:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.71,0:42:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If only my mother could see this!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.17,0:42:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Petrificus Totalus!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.14,0:42:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I love Fantasic Beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.72,0:42:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they pay you well?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.02,0:43:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.63,0:43:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.75,0:43:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Peeves!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.32,0:43:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.95,0:43:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.63,0:43:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not as though anything worse could happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.21,0:43:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.96,0:43:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me that thing was immune to magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.10,0:43:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Voldemort feed that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.52,0:43:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Plan B, darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.11,0:43:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.81,0:43:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If Malfoy doesn't show up with that sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.41,0:43:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.47,0:43:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.07,0:43:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just stay here with my own thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.00,0:44:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And this lovely view of the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.02,0:44:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Has that stain always been there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.42,0:44:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.28,0:44:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.00,0:44:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I saw Malfoy and the others running into the castle earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.45,0:44:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.95,0:44:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.93,0:44:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.14,0:44:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.74,0:44:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.78,0:44:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.63,0:44:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.14,0:44:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Away from here! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.18,0:44:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We must flee while we still can, or he'll kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.00,0:44:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a friend in Russia. I'll ask him for help!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.59,0:44:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.10,0:44:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't argue! Your defiance has cost us everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.47,0:44:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And if we don't hurry, it'll cost us our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.98,0:45:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then go without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.14,0:45:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.60,0:45:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.30,0:45:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not abandoning Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.05,0:45:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I love him, mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.45,0:45:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia, Potter is-
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.83,0:45:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you truly want?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.25,0:45:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, we're Malfoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.68,0:45:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You always taught me our name meant something greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.20,0:45:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When did that became living beneath someone else's feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.38,0:45:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you abandon our pride to become his servant?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.15,0:45:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of being pure blood if we bow our heads to a power hungry half blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.47,0:45:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you truly that afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.30,0:45:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what he's capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.31,0:45:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid of him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.31,0:45:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we don't stop him now,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.28,0:45:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,there'll be no freedom,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.15,0:45:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,no world where our name means anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.55,0:46:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.78,0:46:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Harry's wand.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.52,0:46:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I took it when we thought he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.01,0:46:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He has yours, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.80,0:46:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take his.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.84,0:46:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.72,0:46:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made your choice, my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.91,0:46:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm... We're proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.53,0:46:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.08,0:46:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.56,0:46:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.39,0:46:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're tired too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.61,0:46:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Even behind that face, you're still human.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.63,0:46:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.29,0:46:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're afraid of dying too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.32,0:46:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.90,0:47:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I won't waste another second!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.19,0:47:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.40,0:47:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we really going to do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.16,0:47:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not their servants!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.49,0:47:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Slytherins!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.49,0:47:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.95,0:47:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not Death Eaters!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.08,0:47:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This castle is our home too!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.88,0:47:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Hogwarts students!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.74,0:48:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You alright, Gryffindor?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.50,0:48:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.04,0:48:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.56,0:48:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.42,0:48:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.42,0:48:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.71,0:48:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.99,0:48:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.26,0:48:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you fight a werewolf?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.69,0:48:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.33,0:48:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.60,0:48:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a big snake, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.32,0:48:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, have you seen a sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.56,0:48:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver, with red jewels in the hilt?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.70,0:48:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you need a sword for?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.79,0:48:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To kill the snake that ruined my new dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.18,0:48:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So... the snake is real?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.70,0:49:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.73,0:49:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you have authority over everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.01,0:49:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can steal their dreams and hopes?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.63,0:49:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Never! You're alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.12,0:49:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.58,0:49:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.87,0:49:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.65,0:50:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This is despair!!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.67,0:50:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Harry had driven them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.25,0:50:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.79,0:50:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.37,0:50:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.63,0:50:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody wake me up...!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.15,0:50:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Dementors...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.14,0:50:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like it, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.30,0:50:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The Death Eaters aren't my army.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.32,0:51:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They're merely my infantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.03,0:51:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My personal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.74,0:51:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my true army.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.94,0:51:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gathered from every corner of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.41,0:51:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,An army of death itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.53,0:51:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, no one can stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.37,0:51:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.13,0:51:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A simple Patronus cannot repel so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.48,0:51:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'd bury you all beneath the ruins of this school,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.36,0:51:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and that is exactly what I intend to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.65,0:51:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And all of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.96,0:51:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.92,0:51:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.98,0:51:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.00,0:52:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.01,0:52:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.56,0:52:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.71,0:52:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Take comfort in knowing that before I kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.90,0:52:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you weep over her soulless corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.83,0:52:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.10,0:52:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No...!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.08,0:52:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.97,0:52:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born believing my name meant something greater than myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.45,0:52:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That the world somehow owed me a favour,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.76,0:52:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,simply because I had been born a Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.43,0:52:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I grew up surrounded by luxury,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.72,0:52:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,praise,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.73,0:52:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,people desperate for my approval, and my father's.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.04,0:52:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Some even called me the pure blood princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.83,0:53:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And for a good part of my life, I actually believed that nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.40,0:53:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone wanted my attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.32,0:53:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,my approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.58,0:53:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And really... who wouldn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.80,0:53:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.91,0:53:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry Potter. The boy who lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.52,0:53:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd heard so many stories about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.41,0:53:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and I believed if anyone was worthy of my friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.12,0:53:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,surely it would be someone with his reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.03,0:53:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But he...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.04,0:53:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He brushed me aside as though I were nothing more than an irritating little fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.85,0:53:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he?!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.75,0:53:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he even know who I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.68,0:53:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.21,0:53:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.38,0:53:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore he'd regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.97,0:53:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I swore I'd become the greatest witch I could possibly be.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.78,0:53:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And that one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.06,0:53:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry Potter would be the one living in my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.18,0:53:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.29,0:53:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stop watching him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.63,0:54:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Always surrounded by his friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.53,0:54:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,sharing adventures,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.84,0:54:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,getting into trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.07,0:54:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,facing dangers I could scarcely imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.36,0:54:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.61,0:54:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,he always found a reason to smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.79,0:54:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.23,0:54:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked behind me,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.81,0:54:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and all I saw was darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.32,0:54:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,false smiles,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.66,0:54:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,empty promises,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.33,0:54:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.74,0:54:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Those people never wanted my friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.96,0:54:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanted my father's favour.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.26,0:54:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't care about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.08,0:54:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.86,0:54:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And for the first time, I understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.69,0:54:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite having everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.96,0:54:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.25,0:54:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Without my family name,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.45,0:54:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,who was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.11,0:54:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I understood the weight of that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.69,0:54:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was an only child.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.50,0:54:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The last heir to the Malfoy family.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.20,0:54:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My blood was my family's greatest treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.97,0:55:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was never truly mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.40,0:55:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was expected to marry into another pure blood family,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.56,0:55:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,to preserve our name.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.82,0:55:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't matter whether I loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.56,0:55:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't even matter whether I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.04,0:55:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My future had been decided long before I was old enough to choose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.92,0:55:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd spent my childhood believing I was a princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.20,0:55:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,only to discover that even princesses could live in golden cages.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.03,0:55:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.01,0:55:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.70,0:55:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A boy carrying the hopes of an entire world on his shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.84,0:55:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, when I looked at him: didn't see a famous wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.88,0:55:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a boy who laughed with his friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.16,0:55:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,who made mistakes, who lived,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.39,0:55:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,who was loved for who he was,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.54,0:55:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,not for the name he carried.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.03,0:55:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why could he have real friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.35,0:55:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he seem to walk beneath a light I could never reach?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.99,0:55:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I envied him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.56,0:55:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Merlin, how I envied him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.91,0:55:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.23,0:55:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I began to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.87,0:55:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry was warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.83,0:56:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not merely brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.01,0:56:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He was kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.93,0:56:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,unassuming,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.37,0:56:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.07,0:56:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.49,0:56:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,a little of that light finally reached me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.96,0:56:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.63,0:56:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,someone made me want to become a better person.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.84,0:56:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I'd felt that warmth,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.55,0:56:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I never wanted to lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.86,0:56:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when the darkness came calling again,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.11,0:56:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,even when I was terrified and begged him to leave me behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.25,0:56:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,he wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.17,0:56:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry never turned his back on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.03,0:56:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one who turned my back on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.33,0:56:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I hadn't been so afraid of my father's threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.45,0:56:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.22,0:56:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.35,0:56:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.19,0:56:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That year,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.72,0:56:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I'd known what was coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.91,0:56:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have spent every minute with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.32,0:56:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing else would've mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.04,0:57:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.33,0:57:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.78,0:57:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,when I finally turned around,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.92,0:57:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,he was still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.42,0:57:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All my life, I'd been told whom I should love,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.09,0:57:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,who I should become,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.78,0:57:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,what name I was supposed to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.94,0:57:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one had ever asked me what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.91,0:57:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And what I wanted... was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.84,0:57:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Not his fame,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.37,0:57:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,not his destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.02,0:57:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.95,0:57:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And somehow,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.28,0:57:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My feelings reached him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.78,0:57:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I thought I'd lost him forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.52,0:57:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I watched him rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.78,0:58:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that's what Harry does.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.67,0:58:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He never gives up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.02,0:58:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Not because some prophecy decided his fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.17,0:58:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but simply...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.36,0:58:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...because he's Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.99,0:58:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And if he can keep fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.37,0:58:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,then so can I.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.72,0:58:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let myself be left behind again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.67,0:58:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to return to that darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.66,0:58:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let anyone decide my future for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.27,0:58:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.65,0:58:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,not my blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.86,0:58:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,not even fate itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.05,0:58:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.93,0:58:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...all this time, I've been searching for a happy thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.86,0:58:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,...some precious memory I could hold onto.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.79,0:59:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.28,0:59:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to search the past for a reason to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.05,0:59:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.81,0:59:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you are the reason I want to keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.30,0:59:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.61,0:59:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.25,0:59:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a happy thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.10,0:59:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.08,0:59:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you are all my happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.53,0:59:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.74,1:01:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the power of pure blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.42,1:01:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.64,1:01:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.04,1:01:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.74,1:01:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of power is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.10,1:01:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What... what is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.98,1:01:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a Patronus...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.49,1:01:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that thing up there?!?!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.67,1:02:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucius...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.08,1:02:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.64,1:02:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our little girl. Look what she can do!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.54,1:02:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Shout it, Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.35,1:02:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shout it with all your might!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.79,1:02:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Expecto Patronum!!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.67,1:03:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.23,1:03:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumbledore was right about that girl too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.87,1:03:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit it, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.63,1:03:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was terrified when I saw that army of Dementors.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.32,1:03:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But they were swept away.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.81,1:03:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Death Eaters are almost defeated.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.65,1:03:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.64,1:03:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to see the sunrise with you still breathing!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.81,1:04:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.83,1:04:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.17,1:04:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't bear knowing we breathe the same air.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.18,1:04:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,One of us dies now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.07,1:04:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... what was your happy thought?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.56,1:04:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.86,1:04:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.90,1:04:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.90,1:04:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only have you stolen my master's trust,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.84,1:04:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you've ruined everything for him!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.38,1:04:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rip your heart out through your mouth!!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.49,1:04:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my daughter, you whore.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.49,1:05:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, mum!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.45,1:05:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright, darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.60,1:05:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.20,1:05:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Like father, like daughter!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.49,1:05:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Cissy!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.74,1:05:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to let him do this to me?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.14,1:05:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.76,1:05:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.81,1:05:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill all three of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.54,1:05:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.99,1:05:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We have unfinished business with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.89,1:05:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.62,1:05:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That bitch killed my children.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.61,1:06:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cissy... help me...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.01,1:06:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Cissy!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.58,1:06:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.19,1:06:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pure blood!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.50,1:06:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So were my children.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.05,1:06:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We gave a great deal of thought to how we'd kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.10,1:06:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Torture you until you begged for death.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.37,1:06:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast spell after spell until there was nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.66,1:06:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, we agreed that using magic would be far too merciful for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.13,1:06:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it the Muggle way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.59,1:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.75,1:06:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me, I order you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.73,1:07:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.94,1:07:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be... they're still fighting!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.96,1:07:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Many Death Eaters won't surrender just yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.61,1:07:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry must still be fighting Voldemort.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.83,1:07:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do, darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.94,1:07:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and help him...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.66,1:07:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to be with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.55,1:07:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I feel he needs me too, mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.82,1:07:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.92,1:07:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.66,1:07:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.61,1:07:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already made your choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.19,1:07:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I do to deserve a daughter like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.11,1:07:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventeen years.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.93,1:07:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you wait seventeen years to tell her that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.46,1:08:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that light?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.20,1:08:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And what happened to the Dementors?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.81,1:08:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more concerned about where Malfoy is with the sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.36,1:08:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't wait for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.19,1:08:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to kill it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.80,1:08:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's still hunting us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.51,1:08:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.25,1:09:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around you, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.97,1:09:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They are dying because of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.81,1:09:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's end it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.79,1:09:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.61,1:09:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot win.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.55,1:09:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.23,1:09:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can still fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.67,1:09:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your end, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.08,1:10:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.59,1:10:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.94,1:10:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the snake?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.37,1:10:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The others are taking care of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.18,1:10:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.98,1:10:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. You've saved me the trouble of finding you!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.90,1:10:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you both!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.98,1:10:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.44,1:10:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn this wand!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.91,1:10:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.50,1:10:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia, don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.51,1:10:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We can beat him!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.68,1:11:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.07,1:11:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.00,1:11:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand, Tom?!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.17,1:11:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.63,1:11:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.97,1:11:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The Elder Wand was never yours!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.97,1:11:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Its allegience belongs to her!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.94,1:11:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She disarmed Dumbledore!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.77,1:11:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No...!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.62,1:12:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The wand...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.58,1:12:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...is mine!!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.33,1:12:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still too powerful!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.35,1:12:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.75,1:12:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.50,1:12:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked if you're scared!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.98,1:12:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.66,1:12:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.97,1:12:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this bastard!!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.52,1:12:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron, leave me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.49,1:12:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.36,1:12:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Save yourself, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.38,1:13:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.35,1:13:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Ron!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.33,1:13:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Let her kill me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.33,1:13:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Save yourself, I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.38,1:14:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.82,1:14:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry...!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.04,1:14:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,NOW!!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.98,1:14:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Potter!!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.61,1:14:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bury you beneath the bones of your family!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.45,1:14:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.17,1:15:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Merlin's beard!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.95,1:15:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.40,1:15:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You alright, old man?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.82,1:15:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do I ask for a raise?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.99,1:15:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.92,1:15:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.47,1:16:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut out of my life!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.29,1:17:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.57,1:17:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it! I can't believe it, we actually did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.03,1:17:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.09,1:17:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.06,1:17:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still waiting for you to say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.18,1:17:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.81,1:17:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you still afraid you won't be able to take another step?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.60,1:18:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Draconia.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.27,1:18:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.47,1:18:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.04,1:18:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.08,1:18:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't leave without killing her.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.19,1:18:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,N-... N-....
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.78,1:18:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No... please...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.40,1:18:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.58,1:18:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.49,1:18:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.25,1:18:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,George...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.38,1:18:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling, wait...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.57,1:18:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No... please...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.79,1:19:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My little brother's terrified of spiders.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.81,1:19:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Fred and I once thought of playing a little prank on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.41,1:19:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But the tests went horribly wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.89,1:19:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So we never used it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.20,1:19:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginny.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.73,1:19:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginny would never have done this to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.63,1:19:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But my other half...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.67,1:19:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fred?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.87,1:19:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fred would've loved it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.65,1:19:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.88,1:19:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.72,1:19:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.27,1:20:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No... no... no no... no...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.11,1:20:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.47,1:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And there I was, face to face with a dragon!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.51,1:20:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,An enormous beast, teeth as long as my arm!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.63,1:20:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you fight it, professor?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.36,1:20:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens, no. I ran!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.13,1:20:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.67,1:20:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.55,1:20:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Weasley, I-
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.40,1:20:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, son. You don't have to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.87,1:21:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We're alright. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.90,1:21:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Molly's terribly sorry for what she said.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.05,1:21:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give her time to find the courage to apologise.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.14,1:21:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are Ron and Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.82,1:21:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They're over there, at the far end of the hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.33,1:21:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ron?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.82,1:21:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.73,1:21:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.93,1:21:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy, Hermione.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.85,1:21:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.23,1:21:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You left us alone with that bloody reptile!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.99,1:21:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I couldn't find the sword!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.04,1:21:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Neville found it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.43,1:22:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He came looking for us and killed the snake!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.12,1:22:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.06,1:22:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Neville killed it?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.27,1:22:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it nearly ate us alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.53,1:22:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.37,1:22:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.85,1:22:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You went into the forest to let him kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.38,1:22:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.99,1:22:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.08,1:22:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd lost you forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.57,1:22:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.63,1:22:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.98,1:22:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When you disarmed Dumbledore, you became the true master of the Elder Wand.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.09,1:22:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But Voldemort thought it belonged to Snape.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.75,1:22:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the wand wouldn't obey him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.94,1:22:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Olivander told me a wand cannot kill its own master.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.84,1:22:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It may refuse to work,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.45,1:22:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,or turn against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.57,1:22:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.13,1:22:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps a wand can't kill someone its master loves, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.05,1:22:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.87,1:22:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were alive when Hagrid carried you back?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.95,1:22:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.73,1:23:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I could feel my body,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.51,1:23:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but in my mind, I was running.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.70,1:23:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't wake up, then I heard your voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.67,1:23:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your speech.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.27,1:23:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It led me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.49,1:23:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So... it's mine?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.69,1:23:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.31,1:23:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to return it to Dumbledore's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.78,1:23:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, please, please, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.42,1:23:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll behave.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.46,1:23:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty please let me keep it?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.52,1:23:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but it's far too dangerous for you to keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.33,1:23:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The right thing is to return it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.28,1:23:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But the rules say if you disarm a wizard, their wand becomes yours!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.06,1:23:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And mine was smashed to pieces earlier, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.09,1:23:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mineeeee!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.67,1:23:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep it, others will come looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.84,1:23:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we have to return it to Dumbledore's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.87,1:23:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone hurting you because they crave its power.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.52,1:23:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.82,1:23:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I really didn't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.31,1:24:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've left me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.54,1:24:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to use my secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.96,1:24:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Harry! She's going to hex you!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.12,1:24:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got the Elder Wand!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.64,1:24:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still a Malfoy!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.24,1:24:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Some things never change.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.60,1:24:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.51,1:24:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.60,1:24:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh you dirty little mix...!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.35,1:24:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew you had that in you!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.04,1:24:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.29,1:24:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember those scars I told you about?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.06,1:24:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to see them?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.81,1:24:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me keep the wand, and I'll show you...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.30,1:24:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let me keep the wand and I'll be good to you...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.42,1:24:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We should leave them alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.44,1:25:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Harry gonna be alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.68,1:25:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Am... I going to be alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.57,1:25:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter!!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.06,1:25:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me my wand!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.17,1:25:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My wand, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.22,1:25:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I alread told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.54,1:25:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry...! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.82,1:25:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You smell so nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.36,1:25:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.81,1:25:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You get to play dead only once!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.63,1:25:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Twice, forget it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.11,1:26:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it a third time and I'll kill you myself!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.42,1:26:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been awake for...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.07,1:26:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno, thirty hours?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.96,1:26:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a bath.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.79,1:26:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starving, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.44,1:26:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...how about we get some sleep first?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.75,1:26:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here? With you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.18,1:26:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.80,1:29:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.45,1:29:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hellollo?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.98,1:29:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.57,1:29:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you've enjoyed watching me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.77,1:29:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Still don't know if I'll be in the series.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.19,1:29:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope they get a good actor to play me.
